# NO Qt or KDE lines here any more (2026-09-13). Three used to live here --
# dev-qt/qtbase[icu], dev-qt/qt5compat[icu,qml] and kde-frameworks/sonnet[qml] --
# justified by F33:
#     @graphics -> media-video/vlc[gui] -> dev-qt/qt5compat[qml]
#                                       -> kde-frameworks/qqc2-desktop-style
#                                       -> kde-frameworks/sonnet[qml]
# That chain no longer exists: media-video/vlc moved to flavor/kde/sets/kde,
# because vlc-4 builds its GUI against Qt6 where vlc-3 had no Qt at all.
# Measured -- the minimal plan (910 ebuild lines) contains ZERO dev-qt,
# kde-frameworks, kde-plasma or kde-apps packages, against 162 in the kde plan.
#
# Nothing had to be moved, only removed: the kde layer already carried supersets
# of all three in package.use/kde (`dev-qt/qtbase libproxy icu cups`,
# `dev-qt/qt5compat qml icu`, `kde-frameworks/sonnet qml`).
